  <item>
    <title>【第34期】异地友谊和异地恋没差啊！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65b61ae6513a776b57ae4203</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65b61ae6513a776b57ae4203</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 29 Jan 2024 06:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，欢迎来到九号阳台一起聊聊异地友谊！</span></p><span></span><p><span>聊着聊着变成大型彩虹屁现场？！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="12">00:12</a> 当下情况简要说明：暖暖🇨🇳、馥馥🇦🇺的异地</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="91">01:31</a> 彩蛋：新人物【卓老师】登场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="122">02:02</a> 正片开始！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="160">02:40</a> 时间差的影响</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>暖暖：刚起床就看到一堆未读，不过被牵挂也是件幸福的事情；对于喜欢卡点送祝福的馥馥来说，这种时差应该会有点痛苦</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>馥馥：除此之外，影响不大 （大概还有点好处：澳洲凌晨12点还能找暖暖聊天哈哈哈哈）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="253">04:13</a> 沟通次数和方式的变化 - 减少的面对面交流是否带来疏离感？</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>情绪支持不再有肢体安慰 （男朋友代餐）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>吃醋：不能时时陪伴、“移情别恋”</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>视频聊天加强肢体语言</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="423">07:03</a> 生活节奏的差异 - 共同兴趣减少、没有话题可聊？</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>暖暖：接受人人不同=把朋友当成一本书，你的书架有不同种类的书 （榴莲=心尖上插满了人）；糗事分享=幸灾乐祸，人人在行；吐槽人类=判断关系好的唯一方式；共同活动=电影/音乐/书籍</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>馥馥：口味变的挑剔，不太接受和兴趣不匹配的书籍，包括但不限于：奇怪的三观，对于万物都是随大流没有自己思考的，生活习惯诡异（吸血鬼作息）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="602">10:02</a> 怀念我们当年的心有灵犀</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>平平通过forest察觉暖暖的动态</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>馥&amp;暖：一个眼神她懂我看哪位美女</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1065">17:45</a> 维持友谊的方法</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>小红书的分享</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>视频电话</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>微信时常关心</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>互送礼物（写信）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>【有机会，定相见！】</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lkVdtaRZCXHq3mx3cnR8RDw93VEC.m4a" length="41552004" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:21:31</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZtVmo4c2s3VkVEODZRWHhQbHhpUTVqYlQzbWQucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
